      "extract": "Introduction In this paper, we consider a hyperbolic structure on a manifold to be a Riemannian metric of constant sectional curvature −1 which is not necessarily complete. A hyperbolic 3-manifold is an orientable 3-manifold with a hyperbolic structure. It is well known that the complement of the ﬁgure-eight knot K in the 3-dimensional sphere S3 admits a complete, ﬁnite volume hyperbolic structure σ∞. By",
